{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stick A Round brings the pure nostalgia of childhood to life. We all remember the joy of wandering outdoors, hunting for that one &quot;perfect&quot; stick. The one that felt like a sword, a bow, or a magic wand. In this small open world, that childhood imagination becomes reality.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Search</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Nature does not do repeats. Our procedural generation creates a near infinite number of naturally realistic stick combinations adorned with beautiful flowers, vibrant leaves, sharp thorns, curious mushrooms, and more, ensuring no two adventures are ever the same.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3866080/extras/1e34d45872af4c69f923fa89fb2e60ac.poster.avif?t=1773336303\" width=1170 height=234 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3866080/extras/1e34d45872af4c69f923fa89fb2e60ac.webm?t=1773336303\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3866080/extras/1e34d45872af4c69f923fa89fb2e60ac.mp4?t=1773336303\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Shape-Based Weapons</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bring your stick to a workbench and <strong>identify its shape</strong>. The game reads how your stick bends, curves, and branches and then transforms it into a weapon that matches its shape. A curved stick might behave like a bow while a Y shape is a slingshot. This is how we played as kids, except now your imagination becomes reality.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3866080/extras/55e278ab2a2b7fb4ecafb690935984c4.poster.avif?t=1773336303\" width=1170 height=234 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3866080/extras/55e278ab2a2b7fb4ecafb690935984c4.webm?t=1773336303\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3866080/extras/55e278ab2a2b7fb4ecafb690935984c4.mp4?t=1773336303\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Stick Stats &amp; Modifiers</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every stick is built from parts and every part matters. Its length, weight and shape directly affect damage, knockback, durability, reach, and swing speed. Short, light sticks swing fast. Long, heavy sticks hit harder, but take commitment. Find your perfect stick, master its strengths, and adapt your playstyle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3866080/extras/0119a088540720a30ed6a762d665834f.poster.avif?t=1773336303\" width=1170 height=234 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3866080/extras/0119a088540720a30ed6a762d665834f.webm?t=1773336303\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3866080/extras/0119a088540720a30ed6a762d665834f.mp4?t=1773336303\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Bugs &amp; Temporary Boosts</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hidden throughout the world are bugs that grant <strong>stat boosts</strong>. Catch the right one, and even a humble stick can surprise your friends.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3866080/extras/34387b998910e659ab62c1a3ed98cd8e.poster.avif?t=1773336303\" width=1170 height=234 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3866080/extras/34387b998910e659ab62c1a3ed98cd8e.webm?t=1773336303\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3866080/extras/34387b998910e659ab62c1a3ed98cd8e.mp4?t=1773336303\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Master the Playground</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Prepare for hilariously chaotic combat. Outsmart your friends with precise blocks and parries, or land a massive charge attack to send them flying in a full-blown ragdoll tumble.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3866080/extras/e8afd9611b7cd6605ef5c8409638f15f.poster.avif?t=1773336303\" width=1170 height=234 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3866080/extras/e8afd9611b7cd6605ef5c8409638f15f.webm?t=1773336303\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3866080/extras/e8afd9611b7cd6605ef5c8409638f15f.mp4?t=1773336303\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mini-Games</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Relive the glory days of backyard competition. Jump into private or public lobbies to face off in classic modes like King of the Hill, Infection, Tag, Last Man Standing and more! each minigame requires its own tactics and playstyles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3866080/extras/9dcc9d8492dfe9d13ab1c6b87a2761b7.poster.avif?t=1773336303\" width=1170 height=234 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3866080/extras/9dcc9d8492dfe9d13ab1c6b87a2761b7.webm?t=1773336303\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3866080/extras/9dcc9d8492dfe9d13ab1c6b87a2761b7.mp4?t=1773336303\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A Living World</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The woods change with the passing of time. Explore a dynamic world featuring a full day-night cycle and a seasonal system that brings you Winter, Autumn and Summer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3866080/extras/f5dbf8be71cffaa68f72a94a5d8d88bd.poster.avif?t=1773336303\" width=1170 height=234 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3866080/extras/f5dbf8be71cffaa68f72a94a5d8d88bd.webm?t=1773336303\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3866080/extras/f5dbf8be71cffaa68f72a94a5d8d88bd.mp4?t=1773336303\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Customize your appearance</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Set yourself apart with full character customization. Mix and match skins, hats, and colors to create your own unique animal and show off your personal style.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3866080/extras/7218d8fdb6c48f21dcf86d6bf0e1b793.poster.avif?t=1773336303\" width=1170 height=234 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3866080/extras/7218d8fdb6c48f21dcf86d6bf0e1b793.webm?t=1773336303\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3866080/extras/7218d8fdb6c48f21dcf86d6bf0e1b793.mp4?t=1773336303\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect procedurally generated sticks</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Craft weapons by identifying shapes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stick Combat &amp; Ragdoll physics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Talk to nearby players using proximity chat</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Jump into a variety of fast, replayable mini-games</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Host or join public and private lobbies</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a living world with changing seasons and time cycles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize your character to match your style</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join a friendly, welcoming community of players</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>About the developer</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hi I\u2019m Timo! Stick A Round is my first official project and I\u2019ve been documenting every step of the journey. I\u2019m building this game alongside you. Every suggestion, whether it\u2019s a new stick shape or a funny childhood memory, directly shapes the playground. Want to see how Stick A Round is made or share your ideas? Follow me on socials and join the adventure!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3866080?t=1773336303","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3866080?t=1773336303","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3866080/cc9af0bb51fff5f5c8824e1f9d3e49814b5cd513/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1773336303","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3866080/cc9af0bb51fff5f5c8824e1f9d3e49814b5cd513/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1773336303","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stick A Round brings the pure nostalgia of childhood to life. We all remember the joy of wandering outdoors, hunting for that one &quot;perfect&quot; stick. The one that felt like a sword, a bow, or a magic wand. In this small open world, that childhood imagination becomes reality.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Search</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Nature does not do repeats. Our procedural generation creates a near infinite number of naturally realistic stick combinations adorned with beautiful flowers, vibrant leaves, sharp thorns, curious mushrooms, and more, ensuring no two adventures are ever the same.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3866080/extras/1e34d45872af4c69f923fa89fb2e60ac.poster.avif?t=1773336303\" width=1170 height=234 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3866080/extras/1e34d45872af4c69f923fa89fb2e60ac.webm?t=1773336303\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3866080/extras/1e34d45872af4c69f923fa89fb2e60ac.mp4?t=1773336303\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Shape-Based Weapons</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bring your stick to a workbench and <strong>identify its shape</strong>. The game reads how your stick bends, curves, and branches and then transforms it into a weapon that matches its shape. A curved stick might behave like a bow while a Y shape is a slingshot. This is how we played as kids, except now your imagination becomes reality.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3866080/extras/55e278ab2a2b7fb4ecafb690935984c4.poster.avif?t=1773336303\" width=1170 height=234 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3866080/extras/55e278ab2a2b7fb4ecafb690935984c4.webm?t=1773336303\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3866080/extras/55e278ab2a2b7fb4ecafb690935984c4.mp4?t=1773336303\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Stick Stats &amp; Modifiers</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every stick is built from parts and every part matters. Its length, weight and shape directly affect damage, knockback, durability, reach, and swing speed. Short, light sticks swing fast. Long, heavy sticks hit harder, but take commitment. Find your perfect stick, master its strengths, and adapt your playstyle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3866080/extras/0119a088540720a30ed6a762d665834f.poster.avif?t=1773336303\" width=1170 height=234 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3866080/extras/0119a088540720a30ed6a762d665834f.webm?t=1773336303\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3866080/extras/0119a088540720a30ed6a762d665834f.mp4?t=1773336303\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Bugs &amp; Temporary Boosts</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hidden throughout the world are bugs that grant <strong>stat boosts</strong>. Catch the right one, and even a humble stick can surprise your friends.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3866080/extras/34387b998910e659ab62c1a3ed98cd8e.poster.avif?t=1773336303\" width=1170 height=234 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3866080/extras/34387b998910e659ab62c1a3ed98cd8e.webm?t=1773336303\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3866080/extras/34387b998910e659ab62c1a3ed98cd8e.mp4?t=1773336303\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Master the Playground</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Prepare for hilariously chaotic combat. Outsmart your friends with precise blocks and parries, or land a massive charge attack to send them flying in a full-blown ragdoll tumble.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3866080/extras/e8afd9611b7cd6605ef5c8409638f15f.poster.avif?t=1773336303\" width=1170 height=234 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3866080/extras/e8afd9611b7cd6605ef5c8409638f15f.webm?t=1773336303\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3866080/extras/e8afd9611b7cd6605ef5c8409638f15f.mp4?t=1773336303\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mini-Games</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Relive the glory days of backyard competition. Jump into private or public lobbies to face off in classic modes like King of the Hill, Infection, Tag, Last Man Standing and more! each minigame requires its own tactics and playstyles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3866080/extras/9dcc9d8492dfe9d13ab1c6b87a2761b7.poster.avif?t=1773336303\" width=1170 height=234 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3866080/extras/9dcc9d8492dfe9d13ab1c6b87a2761b7.webm?t=1773336303\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3866080/extras/9dcc9d8492dfe9d13ab1c6b87a2761b7.mp4?t=1773336303\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A Living World</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The woods change with the passing of time. Explore a dynamic world featuring a full day-night cycle and a seasonal system that brings you Winter, Autumn and Summer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3866080/extras/f5dbf8be71cffaa68f72a94a5d8d88bd.poster.avif?t=1773336303\" width=1170 height=234 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3866080/extras/f5dbf8be71cffaa68f72a94a5d8d88bd.webm?t=1773336303\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3866080/extras/f5dbf8be71cffaa68f72a94a5d8d88bd.mp4?t=1773336303\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Customize your appearance</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Set yourself apart with full character customization. Mix and match skins, hats, and colors to create your own unique animal and show off your personal style.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3866080/extras/7218d8fdb6c48f21dcf86d6bf0e1b793.poster.avif?t=1773336303\" width=1170 height=234 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3866080/extras/7218d8fdb6c48f21dcf86d6bf0e1b793.webm?t=1773336303\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3866080/extras/7218d8fdb6c48f21dcf86d6bf0e1b793.mp4?t=1773336303\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect procedurally generated sticks</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Craft weapons by identifying shapes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stick Combat &amp; Ragdoll physics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Talk to nearby players using proximity chat</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Jump into a variety of fast, replayable mini-games</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Host or join public and private lobbies</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a living world with changing seasons and time cycles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize your character to match your style</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join a friendly, welcoming community of players</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>About the developer</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hi I\u2019m Timo! Stick A Round is my first official project and I\u2019ve been documenting every step of the journey. I\u2019m building this game alongside you. Every suggestion, whether it\u2019s a new stick shape or a funny childhood memory, directly shapes the playground. Want to see how Stick A Round is made or share your ideas? Follow me on socials and join the adventure!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["Stick A Round"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3866080/3e55879791b756e74c8fdd12b1e7b05222a08645/header.jpg?t=1773336303","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3866080/390891668/656ec97d3832c9809669d0f28e4ad333901693a6/1754158945/dash_av1.mpd?t=1754161161","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3866080/390891668/656ec97d3832c9809669d0f28e4ad333901693a6/1754158945/dash_h264.mpd?t=1754161161","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3866080/390891668/656ec97d3832c9809669d0f28e4ad333901693a6/1754158945/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1754161161","id":257177373,"name":"Stick A Round Trailer ","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257177373/10fe69cffa4ba050f468f0d54559abd334b90236/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1754161161"}],"name":"Stick A Round","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 or later<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 2 Ghz<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> <br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 4 GB available space</li></ul>"},"platforms":{"linux":false,"mac":false,"windows":true},"publishers":["Stick A Round"],"ratings":{"dejus":{"banned":"0","descriptors":"","rating":"l","rating_generated":"1","required_age":"0","use_age_gate":"0"},"steam_germany":{"banned":"0","descriptors":"","rating":"0","rating_generated":"1","required_age":"0","use_age_gate":"0"}},"release_date":{"coming_soon":true,"date":"To be announced"},"required_age":0,"screenshots":[{"id":0,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steams